{"id":199,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"英語と探究を軸に自ら学ぶ富士見丘","feature_description":"富士見丘学園は英語教育、探究学習、ICT活用、国際交流を組み合わせた中高一貫教育を行っています。中学では英語の授業を週6〜8時間設け、オンライン英会話や英作文の指導も行います。全員が取り組む「自主研究5×2」では、自分で決めた問いを調べ、発表する経験を重ねます。英語で考え、発信する経験を継続して積みます。学びを通して主体性と発信力を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":3498,"name":"テニス部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3500,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3501,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3502,"name":"ダンス部（中学）","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3503,"name":"ゴルフ部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3504,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3506,"name":"ESS部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3507,"name":"クッキング部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3508,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3509,"name":"華道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3510,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3511,"name":"模擬国連部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimigaoka.ac.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":3512,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujimiga